                        </p>

                        <a href="cv.html"
                           class="contact-link">
                            View Professional Documents
                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ===============================
             PROFESSIONAL CONNECTIONS
        =============================== -->

        <section class="section">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="overview-grid">

                    <div class="overview-label">
                        Opportunities
                    </div>

                    <div class="overview-content">

                        <p>
                            My background is interdisciplinary, and I am particularly
                            interested in opportunities where program leadership,
                            education, physical activity, research, athletics,
                            operations, and community engagement intersect.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            I am also interested in connecting with professionals,
                            organizations, researchers, educators, recreation
                            agencies, and sport leaders working on problems related
                            to participation, program development, physical activity,
                            access, and community impact.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            If my experience or research aligns with your work,
                            I welcome the opportunity to connect.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ===============================
             AREAS OF INTEREST
        =============================== -->

        <section class="section section-light">
            <div class="container">

                <h2 class="section-title">Areas of Interest</h2>

                <p class="section-intro">
                    Areas where professional conversations and collaborations
                    may be particularly relevant.
                </p>

                <div class="interest-tags">

                    <span class="interest-tag">Program Leadership</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Kinesiology</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Recreation</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Athletics</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Education</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Research</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Community Physical Activity</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Program Development</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Sport Management</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Coaching</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Physical Activity Access</span>
                    <span class="interest-tag">Organizational Leadership</span>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ===============================
             CTA
        =============================== -->

        <section class="cta">
            <div class="container">

                <h2>
                    Interested in working together?
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Reach out to discuss professional opportunities,
                    collaboration, research, programming, or other areas
                    of mutual interest.
                </p>

                <!-- Replace with your actual email -->
                <a href="mailto:YOUR-EMAIL-HERE" class="btn">
                    Contact Me
                </a>

            </div>
        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- ===============================
         FOOTER
    =============================== -->

    <footer>

        <div class="container footer-content">

            <div>
                © 2026 Jeffrey Jaymot
            </div>

            <div>
                Kinesiology • Education • Leadership • Research
            </div>

        </div>

    </footer>

</body>

</html>
